DURATION:PT5M
RRULE:FREQ=DAILY
SUMMARY:Check Interval
DESCRIPTION:Open Interval\, search Getaways for Aruba\, sort by Price\, then
  tap the Grab bookmark. Two taps and the board is current.\n\nhttps://vip.in
  tervalworld.com/\n\nNothing watches Interval for you: there is no feed and n
  o alert to switch on. The board is as fresh as the last time somebody looked
 \, and it says so on every row.
URL:https://vip.intervalworld.com/
